2026-07-27T10:24:27.0282819Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T10:24:27.0283478Z i /tmp/RtmpXkQY3N/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:24:27.0283923Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:24:27.0284797Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:24:27.0285260Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:24:27.0285985Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:24:27.0287060Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:24:27.0288280Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
